        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ShadowStrikeVR&quot; is a sniper-themed VR shooting game and an award-winning entry in the Qualcomm XR Contest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the protagonist &quot;Shadow,&quot; embarking on a journey from a simple revenge mission to gradually shouldering the responsibility of rebuilding the world order, ultimately undertaking a transcendent hunting spree across time and space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features: Immersive sniper-themed storyline experience; deeply optimized interactive controls; a variety of cold and hot weapons and props; rich scene levels and mission modes; supports both single-player and multiplayer online modes, all designed to provide you with a new experience in VR sniper shooting games! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------Gorgeous Divider--------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Information:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For detailed game procedures and gameplay instructions, please refer to the &quot;ShadowStrikeVR Game Manual&quot; on this page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to engage in discussions with the developers and other players, feel free to join the QQ group: 429947963.</p>",
